|\n| `crates/oulipoly-runtime/tests/provider_settings_host.rs` | `accessor`, `filter`, `formatter`, `mapper`, `orchestration`, `parser`, `validator` | Provider settings host request/response fixture assertions. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-runtime/usage-refresh-locks/age222-marker-a.lock` | `formatter` | Static lock fixture artifact; no executable code. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-state/src/db.rs` | `accessor`, `mapper`, `predicate`, `validator` | Existing state DB reads for session-turn delivery confirmation; no schema ownership. |\n| `crates/oulipoly-state/src/mailbox.rs` | `accessor`, `formatter`, `mapper`, `orchestration`, `predicate`, `validator` | Sidecar mailbox delivery, claim, attempt, and session runtime metadata operations. |\n| `planning/s10b-gate/.scratch/code-quality/s10b/logs/cohesion-auditor.log` | `formatter` | Historical auditor log artifact touched in the source range; not product code. |\n| `planning/s10b-gate/.scratch/code-quality/s10b/logs/coupling-auditor.log` | `formatter` | Historical auditor log artifact touched in the source range; not product code. |\n| `planning/s10b-gate/.scratch/code-quality/s10b/logs/coupling-auditor.rerun2.log` | `formatter` | Historical auditor log artifact touched in the source range; not product code. |\n| `scripts/opencode-turns` | `accessor`, `filter`, `formatter`, `mapper`, `orchestration`, `parser`, `predicate`, `validator` | Shipped OpenCode turn adapter; S11 net delta includes executable-bit remediation only. |\n| `scripts/tests/opencode-turns.test.sh` | `accessor`, `formatter`, `orchestration`, `predicate`, `validator` | Shell harness for the OpenCode turn adapter. |\n| `src-tauri/Cargo.toml` | `formatter` | Manifest dependency/test target surface. |\n| `src-tauri/src/commands/direct_model.rs` | `accessor`, `formatter`, `mapper`, `orchestration` | Direct model command launch, model-dir capture, and invocation metadata flow. |\n| `src-tauri/src/commands/provider_settings.rs` | `accessor`, `formatter`, `mapper`, `orchestr